<section class="section onehand-section" id="cara" aria-labelledby="onehand-title">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div data-reveal>
        <div class="eyebrow">Dirancang untuk tangan yang sedang pegangan</div>
        <h2 id="onehand-title">Satu jempol.<br />Satu tujuan: gajian.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
        Kamu tidak selalu punya dua tangan, sinyal bagus, atau waktu luang. Jadi kontrolnya
        dibuat sederhana: geser, tahan, tap. Bisa dijeda saat kereta berhenti. Bisa dimainkan
        tanpa suara.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="onehand-grid">
      <div class="phone-wrap" data-reveal>
        <div class="phone-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="thumb-ring" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="phone" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="phone-screen">
            <div class="phone-notch"></div>
            <div class="phone-route-line"></div>
            <div class="phone-gap"></div>
            <div class="phone-hud">
              <div class="phone-hud-top">
                <span><strong>07:42</strong> · SUD</span>
                <span>Rp 9.500</span>
              </div>
              <div class="phone-hud-bottom">
                <div class="phone-stats">
                  <span class="phone-stat"><i></i></span>
                  <span class="phone-stat"><i></i></span>
                  <span class="phone-stat"><i></i></span>
                </div>
                <div class="phone-controls">
                  <span class="phone-brake">Rem</span>
                  <span class="phone-thumb">Geser</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="onehand-copy" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
        <h2>Kereta berhenti. Kamu juga bisa.</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          Setiap perjalanan punya checkpoint. Tutup aplikasi, taruh HP, lalu lanjutkan
          tepat di tempat kamu berhenti. Tidak ada timer yang menghukum kamu karena
          harus turun dulu.
        </p>

        <div class="gesture-list">
          <div class="gesture">
            <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 26 26" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13h20M7 9l-4 4 4 4M19 9l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            <strong>Geser</strong>
            <span>Pindah lane, geser badan, cari celah.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="gesture">
            <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 26 26" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M13 8v5l3 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            <strong>Tahan</strong>
            <span>Rem motor, pegangan KRL, tahan napas.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="gesture">
            <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 26 26" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 4v8l-2 4c-1 2 1 4 3 4h7c2 0 4-2 3-4l-2-4V4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M8 8h9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
            <strong>Tap</strong>
            <span>Naik, turun, pilih kursi, lihat peta.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="onehand-note">
          <span>Portrait-first</span>
          <span>Pause otomatis</span>
          <span>Bisa tanpa audio</span>
          <span>Mode tangan kiri</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
